 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                               MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, M1 2AB Manchester, United Kingdom              AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB922707266\n\nFROM                                                       BILL TO\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                  Westbrook Pharma Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                          Unit 7, Riverside Estate\nM1 2AB Manchester                                         BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                            United Kingdom\nVAT: GB922707266\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 13/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Thamesview Logistics Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street,\nManchester (\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside\nEstate, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Amelia Clarke\n Party B   Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\n Date      13/02/2026",
